  "series_title": "Toriko",
  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 147 episodes of Toriko classified canon/filler (no mixed episodes found by any source checked). QuoteTheAnime's exhaustive 20-episode filler list is the primary source; the Toriko Fandom wiki's own filler-episode category independently confirms 14 of those 20 (the well-known standalone filler blocks: 42-43, 69-70, 80-82, 86, 112-113, 124-125, 130-131). The remaining 6 (episodes 1, 51, 99, 136, 146-147) are recorded as filler on QuoteTheAnime's authority alone — the wiki category doesn't dispute them, it just doesn't have them tagged, which reads as incomplete wiki coverage rather than active disagreement, but this is still a single-source call for those six specifically, flagged in each of their own status_notes. This show has thinner guide coverage than most of this project's other shows (a less mainstream, less-discussed title), worth knowing if this ever needs revisiting. No episode titles included — left for the existing backfill_episode_titles_from_anilist.py (#73) pass. Complete, gap-free, non-overlapping coverage of 1-147 confirmed before writing this file.",
